{"id":"n27304-2-7","stage":4,"title":"거북하다 · 别扭","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27304-2-7-1","ko":"민준이랑 화해는 했니?","zh":"敏俊和你和解了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이랑","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"민준이랑","audio":"/audio/51fe8c7e5b3a50dbeb63.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이랑","audio":"/audio/51fe8c7e5b3a50dbeb63.mp3"}},{"text":"화해는","meaning":"和解，和好","explanation":"화해：和解，和好；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"화해","audio":"/audio/db4e027c704e818015c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86869","senseId":"1","lemma":"화해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화해는","audio":"/audio/2ff27d94a0af67a45294.mp3"}},{"text":"했니?","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했니","audio":"/audio/1889ab3866856ff3fbae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"db4e027c704e8180","term":"화해","zh":"和解，和好","audio":"/audio/db4e027c704e818015c3.mp3","entryId":"86869","definition":"停止战斗，消解曾经对彼此怀有的恶意。","pronunciation":["화해"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/697eb93f42588fb25c1c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27304-2-7-2","ko":"화해는 했지만 그 후로 거북한 관계가 되어 버렸어.","zh":"虽然已经和解了，但从那以后我们的关系就变得很尴尬。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"화해는","meaning":"和解，和好","explanation":"화해：和解，和好；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"화해","audio":"/audio/db4e027c704e818015c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86869","senseId":"1","lemma":"화해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화해는","audio":"/audio/2ff27d94a0af67a45294.mp3"}},{"text":"했지만","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했지만","audio":"/audio/c7f6442815fb12a3f118.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"후로","meaning":"后，以后，之后","explanation":"후：后，以后，之后；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"후","audio":"/audio/084a4bd8972f8d494487.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62885","senseId":"1","lemma":"후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후로","audio":"/audio/518be85f8480ed517099.mp3"}},{"text":"거북한","meaning":"别扭，尴尬","explanation":"거북하다：别扭，尴尬；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"거북하다","audio":"/audio/c1c650e6f7ad1ec178f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27304","senseId":"2","lemma":"거북하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거북한","audio":"/audio/8ce5594f0f22e8b29074.mp3"}},{"text":"관계가","meaning":"关系","explanation":"관계：关系；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"관계","audio":"/audio/18ab6599abaaab1b0c2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21898","senseId":"1","lemma":"관계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"관계가","audio":"/audio/c36f7f210cd28c090b79.mp3"}},{"text":"되어","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되어","audio":"/audio/50e84bc2da43dfbd09ba.mp3"}},{"text":"버렸어.","meaning":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","explanation":"버리다：做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버렸어","audio":"/audio/fe1d7a5ead4341d8e790.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"db4e027c704e8180","term":"화해","zh":"和解，和好","audio":"/audio/db4e027c704e818015c3.mp3","entryId":"86869","definition":"停止战斗，消解曾经对彼此怀有的恶意。","pronunciation":["화해"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"084a4bd8972f8d49","term":"후","zh":"后，以后，之后","audio":"/audio/084a4bd8972f8d494487.mp3","entryId":"62885","definition":"一定时间过去以后。","pronunciation":["후ː"]},{"id":"c1c650e6f7ad1ec1","term":"거북하다","zh":"别扭，尴尬","audio":"/audio/c1c650e6f7ad1ec178f1.mp3","entryId":"27304","definition":"心里不舒服或觉得不自然。","pronunciation":["거ː부카다"]},{"id":"18ab6599abaaab1b","term":"관계","zh":"关系","audio":"/audio/18ab6599abaaab1b0c2d.mp3","entryId":"21898","definition":"两个以上的人、事物、现象等彼此有结下关联；或那种关联。","pronunciation":["관계","관게"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea42bfac7a04c2dcee2e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.197,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27304","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLev